    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ᾱΐσσω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ΐξω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rush down from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκποθεν ὀλέθρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.224
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναΐσσω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.68
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>rush in from above</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθὴρ κατᾰΐσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					100.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>rush, dart through</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρὴν . . κόσμον . . καταΐσσουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					134.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
